        - This is a freeform user profile/bio/resume area. - 

You may leave any information in your user profile that you would like
other users to be aware of (within the bounds of good taste!-), such
as your skills or equipment or knowledge for hire, with as much or as
little detail as you think appropriate.

Other users can search the profiles for the talent, etc. they may need.
You are not required to write a profile, and can edit, replace, or kill
your old profile at any time.
